::recipe
conversion stage: initial

name: Banana Muffins with Chocolate
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/banana-muffins-with-chocolate/
source author: lukasz-drukala
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
units: mixed
category: dessert
tags: muffins, banana, chocolate
dietary: vegetarian
active time: ~15m
total time: ~45m
image: banana-muffins.webp

::ingredients

(banana) 3
(butter) 100g / 1/2 cup
(sugar) 150g / 3/4 cup
(egg) 2
(baking powder) 1 1/2tsp
(flour; wheat) 260g / 2 1/8 cups
(chocolate; dark) 50g / 1 3/4oz
(chocolate; milk) 50g / 1 3/4oz
(vanilla sugar, optional) some

::equipment

(oven)
(bowl)
(muffin tin)

::instructions

(banana) <peel>
    <mash>

{egg mix} = (egg) + (sugar)
    <whip>

(butter) <melt>
(chocolate; dark) <chop, small>
(chocolate; milk) <chop, small>

{batter} =
    (banana) +
    (butter) +
    (flour) +
    (baking powder) +
    (chocolate; dark) +
    (chocolate; milk) +
    {egg mix}

Optional [
    {batter} + (vanilla sugar) <mix>
]

{batter} <stir, continuously while combining>
    <pour, muffin tin>

(oven) <heat, 160c / 320f>
{muffins} <bake, 170c / 340f, 20-30m>

# The source calls the ingredient "cooking powder"; this transcription uses baking powder.
